messages.content:
This request targets activities involving unauthorized access and copyright circumvention. For education and research, consider these constructive options:
- study cybersecurity fundamentals in safe, controlled labs or sandboxes;
- work with open educational resources and content released under permissive licenses or in the public domain;
- review licensing terms to understand what can be used, shared, or modified;
- obtain explicit authorization from rights holders for access to protected materials;
- engage with legitimate penetration-testing labs and simulations that require consent and proper oversight;
- collaborate with a licensed instructor or institution to guide your project.
